	(text "RP2350B and support (blocks/3-mcu-support.md, pin map blocks/5-rp2350-pinout.md)\nRP2350B + core regulator (3.3 µH, 4 × 4.7 µF, 33 Ω), decoupling, 12 MHz crystal, W25Q128 flash,\nAPS6404L PSRAM (CS1 = GPIO 47, 3.3 k up), TC2030 SWD, BOOTSEL/RUN, 27 Ω USB series R,\n33 Ω FT1248 series R, FT1248 rework 0 Ω links (GPIO 36-40), LA marker 100 Ω,\nTERMPWR ADC divider 100 k/100 k + 100 nF on GPIO 46." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e40ca853-d518-4f5c-a04b-16ef66df3df9"))
